            "review_title": "Review at Vesta Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ashleyvietnam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam159 contributions\n0\nWestern dish, Vietnamese price\nJan 2016 • Friends\nThis is the good place for some who can enjoy Asian food or love Western food.\n\nThe menu is plentiful. The soup is delicious and the decorate is very beautiful too.\n\nThe restaurant's space is small but very lovely. The best part is it cheaper than other Western restaurant in Saigon but the quality is the same.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 1, 2016",
