            "review_title": "Review at Vesta Restaurant",
            "review_text": "angeldian\nJakarta, Indonesia10 contributions\n0\nGood Italian food\nNov 2015 • Family\nWe had dinner at Vesta on our first night in HCMC, because it was just across our hotel (Phuc Khan 2 Hotel). We were actually looking for a local restaurant but settled with Vesta since it was already late. Surprisingly, they served good Italian food. We had spaghetti and Cesare salad and they were delicious! Our waiter spoke a little English but managed to get our order correctly.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 21, 2015",
